      "id": 52675,
      "name": "Nielzabub",
      "username": "Nielzabub",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-29T01:10:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If it's an involuntary start of turn action such as Demoralize, Cold Snap, or Impale, then I would say yes, they still happen, since they would go off before you would make the choice of skipping your turn. End of turn actions are a little trickier, but if your interpretation of the rules is that skipping your turn automatically takes you to the end of turn sequence, then yes End of turn actions such as Starshield necklace could still occur. I could be wrong on that, though.</p>",
