    {
      "id": 52677,
      "name": "dypaca",
      "username": "dypaca",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-29T01:30:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When you skip your turn, no end of turn actions occur.&nbsp; So Fanatic would not have to destroy Zealous Offense if she skips her turn.</p><p>If she played a card like Prayer of Desperation which says to end your turn, then end of turn actions still occur, so Zealous Offensive would be destroyed (assuming she did not somehow get the damage dealt).</p>",
